WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Peter Parker: Ever since I got bit by that spider, my life changed forever.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
News Reporter: We reveal the true identity of Spider-Man! His name is Peter Parker!

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
MJ: Peter, the whole world knows now. Look outside!

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Ned: Dude, we're famous! Or infamous, I don't know!

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Peter Parker: I need to fix this. I have to see Doctor Strange.

6
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Doctor Strange: What can I do for you, Peter?

7
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Peter Parker: Can you cast a spell to make everyone forget I'm Spider-Man?

8
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Doctor Strange: The spell of forgetting... It is dangerous and unpredictable.

9
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Wong: Don't cast that spell, Stephen. It tampers with the stability of space-time.

10
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Doctor Strange: Relax, Wong. I've got this completely under control.

11
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Peter Parker: Wait! Not Ned! And not MJ! Can Aunt May remember too?

12
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Doctor Strange: Parker, stop talking! You're altering the parameters of the spell!

13
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:43.000
[A dimensional rift tears open in the sky above the bridge]

14
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Doctor Octopus: Hello, Peter.

15
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Peter Parker: Do I know you?

16
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Doctor Octopus: What have you done with my machine?!

17
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:15.000
[Metal tentacles smash against the highway pavement]

18
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:23.000
Green Goblin: Poor Peter. Too weak to send me home to die.

19
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Norman Osborn: No good deed goes unpunished.

20
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Peter Parker: I can cure you. All of you. You don't have to die.

21
00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:47.000
