01:56:25.000 --> 01:56:31.000
Aunt May: Peter, you did the right thing. If you help someone, you help everyone.

875
01:56:33.000 --> 01:56:39.000
Aunt May: With great power, there must also come great responsibility.

876
01:56:41.000 --> 01:56:47.000
Peter Parker: Aunt May... no, please stay with me!

877
01:56:49.000 --> 01:56:55.000
[Rain pours heavily over the city rooftops]

878
01:56:57.000 --> 01:57:03.000
Peter-Two: I lost someone too. My Uncle Ben.

879
01:57:05.000 --> 01:57:11.000
Peter-Three: I couldn't save Gwen. I will never forgive myself for that.

880
01:57:13.000 --> 01:57:19.000
Peter Parker: We have to finish this together. Cure them all.

881
01:57:21.000 --> 01:57:27.000
Doctor Strange: They're breaking through! I can't hold them back any longer!

882
01:57:29.000 --> 01:57:35.000
Peter Parker: Cast a new spell. Make everyone forget who Peter Parker is.

883
01:57:37.000 --> 01:57:43.000
MJ: But Peter, that means I'll forget you. We will forget you.

884
01:57:45.000 --> 01:57:51.000
Peter Parker: I will come find you. I promise.

885
01:57:53.000 --> 01:57:59.000
MJ: You better, Parker. I love you.

886
01:58:01.000 --> 01:58:07.000
[Golden mystical light blankets the entire Manhattan skyline]

887
01:58:09.000 --> 01:58:15.000
Peter Parker: New apartment, new suit, brand new start.

888
01:58:17.000 --> 01:58:23.000
[Spider-Man leaps gracefully through the falling snow over Rockefeller Center]

889
01:58:25.000 --> 01:58:31.000
Peter Parker: Ever since I got bit by that spider, my life changed forever.

890
01:58:33.000 --> 01:58:39.000
News Reporter: We reveal the true identity of Spider-Man! His name is Peter Parker!

891
01:58:41.000 --> 01:58:47.000
MJ: Peter, the whole world knows now. Look outside!

892
01:58:49.000 --> 01:58:55.000
Ned: Dude, we're famous! Or infamous, I don't know!

893
01:58:57.000 --> 01:59:03.000
Peter Parker: I need to fix this. I have to see Doctor Strange.

894
01:59:05.000 --> 01:59:11.000
Doctor Strange: What can I do for you, Peter?

895
01:59:13.000 --> 01:59:19.000
Peter Parker: Can you cast a spell to make everyone forget I'm Spider-Man?

896
01:59:21.000 --> 01:59:27.000
Doctor Strange: The spell of forgetting... It is dangerous and unpredictable.

897
01:59:29.000 --> 01:59:35.000
Wong: Don't cast that spell, Stephen. It tampers with the stability of space-time.

898
01:59:37.000 --> 01:59:43.000
Doctor Strange: Relax, Wong. I've got this completely under control.

899
01:59:45.000 --> 01:59:51.000
Peter Parker: Wait! Not Ned! And not MJ! Can Aunt May remember too?

900
01:59:53.000 --> 01:59:59.000
Doctor Strange: Parker, stop talking! You're altering the parameters of the spell!

